# Jersey Studio Product Direction

Gamechanger Jersey Studio is an **AI-assisted football shirt replication engine**, not a graphics editor, CAD tool, or multi-garment designer.

## Mission test

Every new feature must answer: **Does this improve the application’s ability to automatically recreate a football shirt from an uploaded image?** If no, do not build it.

## Pipeline

Upload → Garment Recognition → **Garment Recognition Contract** → Designer Review → **Design Specification** → Renderer → Production Artwork

## Hard rules

- Design Specification is the single source of truth for rendering.
- Recognition modules populate the Contract only; they never talk to the renderer.
- Detect and Map are separate (upload findings → Gamechanger equivalents).
- Branding detections are exclusion regions only — never projected into Design Spec.
- One football shirt template, front view, approved V-neck collar family.
- Every recognition module must be independently testable.

## Do not expand

Shorts, socks, kits, 360°, player models, lifestyle scenes, multi-sport, hundreds of templates, renderer redesign for its own sake.

## Leave unchanged (downstream)

Renderer, production template, production validation, production output, Visual QA, fidelity framework.
